{"id":"7f1b713b3ea26325","group":"72","path":"72/72-cor-pure-lk-consistency.md","title":"纯逻辑演算不能证明空相继式","display":"cor-pure-lk-consistency — 纯逻辑演算不能证明空相继式","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-cor-pure-lk-consistency","aliases":["72-cor-pure-lk-consistency"],"display":"cor-pure-lk-consistency — 纯逻辑演算不能证明空相继式","depends_on":["[[72-thm-lk-soundness]]","[[72-df-sequent-validity]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3–2.4, print32–37/PDF44–49; local semantic corollary","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-cor-pure-lk-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-cor-pure-lk-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-pure-lk-consistency — 纯逻辑演算不能证明空相继式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1888eb7039fadfa\" href=\"?note=a1888eb7039fadfa\" title=\"72-thm-lk-soundness\">72-thm-lk-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3–2.4, print32–37/PDF44–49; local semantic corollary"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\mathcal C\">\\(\\Sigma,\\mathcal C\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a1888eb7039fadfa\" href=\"?note=a1888eb7039fadfa\" title=\"72-thm-lk-soundness\">72-thm-lk-soundness</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 是空有限函数序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\vdash q\">\\(\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\)</span> 是有限证明存在性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bigl(\\mathcal C\\vdash\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\bigl(\\mathcal C\\vdash\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>为任意签名取单点域：每个常元解释为唯一点，每个函数解释为唯一的常值函数，每个关系解释为空关系，得到合法非空结构。空相继式的前件全真条件成立，而后件没有真公式，因此不有效。若有证明，可靠性将迫使其有效，矛盾。该推论只涉及纯逻辑；任意不一致非逻辑公理扩充不满足这里的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-lk-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"a1888eb7039fadfa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-lk-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-lk-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"a1888eb7039fadfa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\mathcal C$ 如 [[72-thm-lk-soundness]]；$\\langle\\rangle$ 是空有限函数序列，$\\mathcal C\\vdash q$ 是有限证明存在性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\vdash q","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\bigl(\\mathcal C\\vdash\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1459,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-cor-pure-lk-consistency|cor-pure-lk-consistency — 纯逻辑演算不能证明空相继式]]"}],"outgoing":["a1888eb7039fadfa","ba1b086fe1d56f25"]}